B.alV=s(["Decision tools","Professional discovery","Participant responsibility"],t.s)
B.abS=new A.d1("The role of Pact","Pact provides tools for organizing acquisition decisions and discovering professional support. Buyers, sellers and professionals remain responsible for their own decisions, information and agreements.",B.alV)
